, 2026\",\"description\":\"Read a few activities I am attempting to stay away in 2026\",\"slug\":\"2026-not-todo\"}},\"__N_SSG\":true},\"page\":\"/thoughts/[slug]\",\"query\":{\"slug\":\"2026-goals\"},\"buildId\":\"hzjm1yylUzKOZBeQFuE_S\",\"isFallback\":false,\"gsp\":true,\"scriptLoader\":[]}</script></body></html>","json":{"pageProps":{"contentHtml":"<p>Over the course of 2025, I've come to discover and adopt a few bad habits that I want to detach from in 2026. The following items are those bad habits:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Doom scrolling</li>\n<li>Saying \"yes\" when I shoudn't</li>\n<li>Not sticking to a budget</li>\n<li>Traveling without purpose</li>\n<li>Not taking enough naps</li>\n</ol>\n","meta":{"title":"Bad habits of 2025","date":"Jan 2, 2026","description":"Read a few activities I am attempting to stay away in 2026","slug":"2026-not-todo"}},"__N_SSG":true}}